From 2e76be899ecf8423cdb4c56179a990a54f956fc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] avalanche: add mempool batch voting and preconsensus policy

Add MSG_AVA_MEMPOOL_BATCH voting, enforce finalized mempool batch
Subtree A compliance in PreConsensusPolicy, retire legacy per-tx radix
preconsensus, and add unit tests (preconsensus_batch_tests.cpp) and
functional tests (abc_p2p_avalanche_batch_and_treasury.py).
